    "description": "From January of 1994 and to date, weekly censuses of birds and  marine mammals\nhave been taken in the coastal sector of Chile Bay, between the Caleton Iquique\nand the English Strait located near Greenwich Island. In addition, the activity\nof the animals and atmospheric variables were measured simultaneously. \n\nEn Espanol:\nEntre enero de 1994 y hasta la fecha, se han efectuado censo semanales de aves\ny mamiferos marinos en el sector costero de Bahia Chile, entre el Caleton\nIquique y el Estrecho Ingles ubicado en Isla Greenwich. Ademas se registro la\nactividad de los animales y las variables atmosfericas del momento.",
